From fca46a76febdc37f1da7eba7f3b94e3ca2405327 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ege=20Co=C5=9Fkun?= <randward@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 07:56:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 15/33] drm/panel: novatek-nt36523: Add Samsung Galaxy Tab S7
 CSOT panel

Add the CSOT PPA957DB1 panel of the Samsung Galaxy Tab S7 Wi-Fi. It is a
dual DSI C-PHY video mode panel. The init sequence and timings come from
the vendor devicetree, where the horizontal timings are per link.

Its brightness is set with DCS over both links and ranges up to 462, so
allow the panel description to set the maximum brightness.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
